   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AMREF Mobile Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support is to the East African Lake Victoria Partnership through AMREF in collaboration with the Lake Victoria Basin Commission. The goals are to harmonise and coordinate work on mobile populations and HIV in the lake basin, support capacity for networks and  organisations for mobile populations, and to conduct sero-behavioural studies (as well as to identify best practices) for three categories</narrative>
